<title>USA: Casino Data Systems named in class action.</title>
<headline>Casino Data Systems named in class action.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Data Systems said it has been named by one of its shareholders as a defendant in a purported class action lawsuit.</p>
<p>The company said the lawsuit alleges that it and certain of its directors and officers violated certain provisions of the federal securities laws.</p>
<p>The company said it believes that the lawsuit is without merit and plans to defend the lawsuit vigorously.</p>
</text>
